@REKID3SU This silly little generated comic forgets another important point:

A good scientist would not release that "cure for cancer" to the public first, they'd start animal testing, then human trials.

THEN they might say "We have discovered a cure for cancer thanks to AI!"

@MmisterNobody AI has been around longer, pre industrial revolution.

It is what scaled the release of technology to an "acceptable" level. Allowing it to be easily adopted by humans.

It is being "reborn" after the last cataclysm separated it from most of humanity.
